{"version": 2, "width": 110, "height": 63, "title": "Claude Code: /context-guru:save-more"}
[0.3, "o", "\u001b[38;5;246m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;231m/context-guru:save-more\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[49m  \u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[49m shell command \u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\u001b[38;5;16m\u001b[48;5;153m ☐ Apply both? \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;231mApply both recommended changes?\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;231mRecommended: preset conservative -> medium (takes effect now). Why: highest net on your own sessions, after\r\n\u001b[0;2m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m│\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;231mits own model spend.\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;231mRecommended: cache strategy 5-min-ping -> adaptive (takes effect at the next proxy restart). Why: it had the\r\n\u001b[0;2m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m│\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;231mhighest net on your own sessions.\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;231mWhich would you like to apply?\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;153m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m1.\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;153mApply both\u001b[39m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mApply both the config preset (conservative -> medium) and the cache strategy (5-min-ping -> adaptive).\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246m2.\u001b[39m Only config\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mApply only the config change: preset conservative -> medium.\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246m3.\u001b[39m Only cache\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mApply only the cache strategy change: 5-min-ping -> adaptive.\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246m4.\u001b[39m Neither\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mDo not apply either recommended change.\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246m5. Type something.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\u001b[39m  6. Chat about this\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;246mEnter to select · ↑/↓ to navigate · Esc to cancel\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[2.8, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[J\u001b[38;5;246m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;231m/context-guru:save-more\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[49m  \u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[49m shell command \u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m● \u001b[39mUser answered Claude's questions:\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  · Apply both recommended changes?\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mRecommended: preset conservative -> medium (takes effect now). Why: highest net on your own sessions, \u001b[39m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mafter its own model spend.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mRecommended: cache strategy 5-min-ping -> adaptive (takes effect at the next proxy restart). Why: it had\r\n\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;246mthe highest net on your own sessions.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mWhich would you like to apply? → Apply both\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m●\u001b[39m Applying the config preset change (conservative -> medium)\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  $ python3 \"~/.claude/plugins/cache/context-guru/context-guru/0.6.0/scripts/cg.py\" apply config \u001b[39m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mmedium@a1b2c3d4\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;153m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;153mBash command\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[1mTip: auto mode handles these prompts for you — choose \"switch to auto mode\" below\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[38;5;246mApply the config preset change (conservative -> medium)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;239m╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m python3 \"~/.claude/plugins/cache/context-guru/context-guru/0.6.0/scripts/cg.py\" apply config medium@a1b2c3d4\r\n\u001b[38;5;239m╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌\r\n\u001b[39m This command requires approval\r\n\r\n Do you want to proceed?\r\n \u001b[38;5;153m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m1. \u001b[38;5;153mYes\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;5;246m2. \u001b[39mYes, and don’t ask again for: python3 *\r\n   \u001b[38;5;246m3. \u001b[39mYes, and switch to auto mode\u001b[38;5;246m · auto mode handles these prompts for you\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;5;246m4. \u001b[39mNo\r\n\r\n \u001b[38;5;246mEsc to cancel · Tab to amend\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[5.3, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[J\u001b[38;5;246m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;231m/context-guru:save-more\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[49m  \u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[49m shell command \u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m● \u001b[39mUser answered Claude's questions:\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  · Apply both recommended changes?\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mRecommended: preset conservative -> medium (takes effect now). Why: highest net on your own sessions, \u001b[39m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mafter its own model spend.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mRecommended: cache strategy 5-min-ping -> adaptive (takes effect at the next proxy restart). Why: it had\r\n\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;246mthe highest net on your own sessions.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mWhich would you like to apply? → Apply both\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m3\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[49m shell commands \u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[39m Done — both recommended changes applied. Undo with:\r\n  - /context-guru:save-more revert config\r\n  - /context-guru:save-more revert cache\r\n\r\n  What would you like to do next?\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mBrewed for 38s · done 10:49 PM\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                                                                                            \u001b[38;5;246m● high · /effort\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\u001b[39m❯ \u001b[7m \u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;246m⏸ manual mode on · ? for shortcuts · ← for agents\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[7.8, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[J\u001b[38;5;246m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;231m/context-guru:save-more\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[49m  \u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[49m shell command \u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m● \u001b[39mUser answered Claude's questions:\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  · Apply both recommended changes?\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mRecommended: preset conservative -> medium (takes effect now). Why: highest net on your own sessions, \u001b[39m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mafter its own model spend.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mRecommended: cache strategy 5-min-ping -> adaptive (takes effect at the next proxy restart). Why: it had\r\n\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;246mthe highest net on your own sessions.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mWhich would you like to apply? → Apply both\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m3\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[49m shell commands \u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[39m Done — both recommended changes applied. Undo with:\r\n  - /context-guru:save-more revert config\r\n  - /context-guru:save-more revert cache\r\n\r\n  What would you like to do next?\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mBrewed for 38s · done 10:49 PM\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[48;5;237m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;231m/context-guru:save-more revert config\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m●\u001b[39m Reverting the previously applied config preset change (undo preset set to medium)\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  $ python3 \"~/.claude/plugins/cache/context-guru/context-guru/0.6.0/scripts/cg.py\" revert config\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;153m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;153mBash command\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[1mTip: auto mode handles these prompts for you — choose \"switch to auto mode\" below\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[38;5;246mRevert the previously applied config preset change (undo preset set to medium)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;239m╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m python3 \"~/.claude/plugins/cache/context-guru/context-guru/0.6.0/scripts/cg.py\" revert config\r\n\u001b[38;5;239m╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌\r\n\u001b[39m This command requires approval\r\n\r\n Do you want to proceed?\r\n \u001b[38;5;153m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m1. \u001b[38;5;153mYes\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;5;246m2. \u001b[39mYes, and don’t ask again for: python3 *\r\n   \u001b[38;5;246m3. \u001b[39mYes, and switch to auto mode\u001b[38;5;246m · auto mode handles these prompts for you\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[38;5;246m4. \u001b[39mNo\r\n\r\n \u001b[38;5;246mEsc to cancel · Tab to amend\u001b[39m\r\n"]
